From: Petar Tijanic <petartijanic01@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 14:03:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] RDKEMW-18589: Toggle ManetteGamepadProvider via
 USE_MANETTE_GAMEPAD_PROVIDER

Add USE_MANETTE_GAMEPAD_PROVIDER cmake option (default ON) that switches
between the ManetteGamepadProvider (direct libmanette) and the original
GamepadLibWPE (libwpe gamepad) backend.

When USE_MANETTE_GAMEPAD_PROVIDER is ON:
- FindManette.cmake searches for manette-1 first, falls back to manette-0.2
- WebCore builds ManetteGamepad.cpp/ManetteGamepadProvider.cpp
- WebKit builds UIGamepadProviderManette.cpp

When OFF:
- WebCore builds GamepadLibWPE.cpp/GamepadProviderLibWPE.cpp
- WebKit builds UIGamepadProviderLibWPE.cpp
- Original libwpe-based gamepad input routing is preserved
